abstract: >-
  This software investigates the use of FLIR infrared imaging in the context
  of Complex Regional Pain Syndrome (CRPS) treatment. The interactive Wolfram
  Mathematica notebook extracts, masks, summarizes, visualizes, and compares
  paired thermal-image temperature distributions.
keywords:
  - complex regional pain syndrome
  - CRPS
